| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| **Audit log minimum retention** | LOCKED: Audit log entries are retained for a minimum of 7 years. After 2 years, entries may be archived to cold storage but must remain queryable within 24 hours. This minimum cannot be reduced. | 7 years minimum — not reducible | **7 years** | Platform — not configurable below minimum | P05 Audit Log |
| **Statutory data hard delete block** | LOCKED: Hard deletion of statutory records (payroll, PF, TDS) is blocked at both the application and database layers. Statutory data can only be archived — not deleted. | Blocked — system-enforced | **Blocked** | Platform — not configurable | M06 · M07 · P05 |
| Non-statutory PII retention period | Configurable retention period per data category after employee exit. Automated deletion scheduled on expiry. | Days — configurable per category | To be configured per data category | Org Admin | M01 · DPDPA 2023 compliance |
| Separated employee portal access period | Separated employees retain read-only access to own payslips and documents for a configurable period after exit. | Days — configurable | To be configured | Org Admin | M01 lifecycle · M06 payslips |

