| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| Consent capture at onboarding | Consent for data collection and processing captured during employee onboarding (M02). Consent records are immutable — they can be superseded but never deleted. | Mandatory — Phase 1 M02 | Enabled — Phase 1 | Platform — enforced in M02 | M02 Onboarding · DPDPA compliance |
